WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.884
One fall day, the North Wind blew the clouds quickly across the sky.

2
00:00:12.885 --> 00:00:15.924
"Look how fast I can blow the clouds!

3
00:00:15.925 --> 00:00:21.824
I am so strong!" he bragged.

4
00:00:21.825 --> 00:00:25.237
"What nonsense!" said the Sun.

5
00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:28.442
"I am much stronger than you!"

6
00:00:28.443 --> 00:00:30.846
"No, you are not!"

7
00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:32.879
"Yes, I am!"

8
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:35.320
They argued with one another.

9
00:00:35.321 --> 00:00:38.460
The North Wind saw a traveler walking on the road.

10
00:00:38.461 --> 00:00:39.792
He had an idea.

11
00:00:39.793 --> 00:00:42.944
"Look! A traveler is coming this way.

12
00:00:42.945 --> 00:00:45.534
Let me prove how strong I am!

13
00:00:45.535 --> 00:00:49.402
I will force him to take off his coat," he said.

14
00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:55.188
"Ha-ha! You cannot!" said the Sun.

15
00:00:55.189 --> 00:00:57.784
"Just watch me!"

16
00:00:57.785 --> 00:01:00.404
The North Wind blew and blew.

17
00:01:00.405 --> 00:01:03.885
Dust and leaves flew everywhere.

18
00:01:03.886 --> 00:01:08.009
"Ohh! What a sudden wind!" said the traveler.

19
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.936
"I need to button up my coat."

20
00:01:11.937 --> 00:01:17.149
"Hmm! Okay, watch this!" said the North Wind.

21
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.376
Then he blew his hardest.

22
00:01:19.377 --> 00:01:22.914
But the traveler did not take off his coat.

23
00:01:22.915 --> 00:01:26.291
"Brr! What a terrible day!

24
00:01:26.292 --> 00:01:29.769
I must pull up my collar," said the traveler.

25
00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:34.290
He held his collar tightly around his neck.

26
00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:37.856
The North Wind was out of breath and very tired.

27
00:01:37.857 --> 00:01:42.085
"Ha-ha! Look at you!" said the Sun.

28
00:01:42.086 --> 00:01:46.695
"Now, step aside. It is my turn."

29
00:01:46.696 --> 00:01:52.589
So the Sun smiled and held out her arms toward the traveler.

30
00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:57.594
"Hmm, this is very strange weather!" said the traveler.

31
00:01:57.595 --> 00:01:59.669
"It's getting warmer now."

32
00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:01.968
He unbuttoned his coat.

33
00:02:01.969 --> 00:02:07.054
The Sun put on a bigger smile and climbed higher into the sky.

34
00:02:07.055 --> 00:02:09.932
The traveler took off his coat.

35
00:02:09.933 --> 00:02:13.854
"Whew! It is very hot now!"

36
00:02:13.855 --> 00:02:18.300
"Oh no!" cried the North Wind.

37
00:02:18.301 --> 00:02:24.974
"Ah, look! I made the traveler take off his coat," said the Sun.

38
00:02:24.975 --> 00:02:31.994
"All right, you win," said the North Wind, and slid away.

39
00:02:31.995 --> 00:02:36.239
The traveler took off his shoes and stopped to rest under a tree.

40
00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:41.342
The happy Sun smiled even wider and kept him warm as he slept.

41
00:02:41.343 --> 00:02:44.895
"Poor North Wind," said the Sun.

42
00:02:44.896 --> 00:02:51.446
"It is better to be friendly to people than to force them."
